cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ssc2: Install Stata packages from date-based snapshots of the SSC archive"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/labordynamicsinstitute/stata-ssc2"
abstract: >-
  ssc2 is a drop-in replacement for the system-provided Stata ssc command.
  It adds a date() option to install packages as of a given date using
  date-based snapshots of the SSC archive, supporting reproducible research.
authors:
  - family-names: Vilhuber
    given-names: Lars
    affiliation: "Labor Dynamics Institute, Cornell University"
  - family-names: Joyce
    given-names: Ian
    affiliation: "University of Notre Dame"
keywords:
  - stata
  - reproducibility
  - snapshot
  - SSC
